  "purpose": "Omega LLM v0 (aien-train#52) and v1 (#54): decoder-only transformer trained from random init in seeded .om; v0 byte-level 119104 parameters, v1 adds a BPE tokenizer (bpe.om), shapes to V4096, gradient blocks G and K worker processes (units math, data, model, adam, ckpt, bpe, cli, then lio or eio; concatenated in that order); CPU only, no GPU",
